==Chapter==
*EoC - [[Empire of Cats]]
*ItF - [[Into the Future]]
*CotC - [[Cats of the Cosmos]]

==0/1/2/3/4==
*0 - None unlocked, only applies for ItF and CotC
*1 - Chapter 1 unlocked
*2 - Chapter 2 unlocked
*3 - Chapter 3 unlocked
*4 - Aku Realms unlocked (Only applies to EoC as of {{CurrentVer}})

==Treasure==
*The amount of superior treasure obtained

==Outbreak==
*0 - No outbreaks active
*1 - Outbreaks yet to be completed
*2 - All outbreaks completed
*3 - Filibuster, only applies for CotC

==Invasions==
*The amount of Aku invasions beaten

==Usage==
<pre>
{{Mainchapter|EoC|4|48|48|48|1|1|1|50}}
</pre>
